### Create new coupon
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/coupons
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "code": "TEST-COUPON-001",
  "maxUsage": 5,
  "country": "PL"
}

### Create new coupon - Invalid country code
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/coupons
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "code": "TEST-COUPON-001",
  "maxUsage": 5
}

### Register coupon usage by user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/coupons/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
X-Forwarded-For: 83.10.45.67

{
  "userId": "user-1",
  "code": "TEST-COUPON-001"
}